Description: Research compendium for a systematic review and Bayesian
    meta-analysis of employment outcomes in first-episode psychosis, covering
    employment prevalence and the effect of Individual Placement and Support
    (IPS) on competitive employment. Provides the data-cleaning pipeline,
    Bayesian and frequentist analysis scripts, and the deterministic checks
    (schema, correction ledger, identity crosswalk, fit registry and
    reproducibility manifest) that verify the pipeline before any refit.
